WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,600
Brother

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:05,060
Why don't you give it to him?

3
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:08,340
There's no need for us to risk our lives for this little thing, bro.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,140
You often say that the life you have left alone has everything.

5
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,750
We can't use Li Mo together now

6
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:14,790
You swear you will lure the beast away

7
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:16,470
Otherwise, you will definitely not die well in the future.

8
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:17,870
OK no problem

9
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:22,350
But you also have to swear to hand over all your gains and not keep anything secret.

10
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:32,280
There are only so many

11
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:33,960
Don't you have anything to hide?

12
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,080
How many do you think there can be?

13
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,800
This is a secret realm, not a vault

14
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:43,150
It’s not easy to live till now and gain something. In this case

15
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:44,110
Look at the fire

16
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:45,390
We'll see you later

17
00:00:45,830 --> 00:00:49,780
Finally left

18
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,300
It's safe now

19
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,900
I didn’t expect that Li Mo was quite trustworthy.

20
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:55,020
Thanks to my brother's plan, I lost a few bodies.

21
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:57,940
The most important thing is that I can save my brother and don’t have to worry about the oath.

22
00:00:58,100 --> 00:00:59,860
That thing is useless for deceiving fools.

23
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:01,660
How could I care about that kind of thing

24
00:01:02,220 --> 00:01:04,340
I was just thinking about what Li Mo said before leaving

25
00:01:04,620 --> 00:01:06,020
I can understand if you keep an eye on the fire

26
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:07,860
But why did he say there will be a time later?

27
00:01:08,220 --> 00:01:14,060
Because we will definitely see each other again when we return to school. Oh no, we were fooled. Pack your things and leave immediately.

28
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:16,930
Li Mo, you are not trustworthy.

29
00:01:17,090 --> 00:01:18,010
You swore an oath

30
00:01:18,170 --> 00:01:19,330
Aren't you afraid of fulfilling your oath?

31
00:01:19,490 --> 00:01:20,490
I promise to lure away the beast

32
00:01:20,650 --> 00:01:22,330
But he didn't promise not to bring them back again.

33
00:01:22,490 --> 00:01:24,330
I didn't break my oath but you

34
00:01:24,610 --> 00:01:26,050
I swear to say that I have nothing to hide.

35
00:01:26,210 --> 00:01:27,730
But that thing was not handed over

36
00:01:27,970 --> 00:01:29,330
Is this really a violation of the oath?

37
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:34,070
How do you know it's important? Even if you go far away

38
00:01:34,390 --> 00:01:35,950
Xiao Kunpeng hidden in the sky

39
00:01:36,230 --> 00:01:38,070
I have already investigated everything clearly

40
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:42,200
I said hand that thing over now.

41
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:43,680
can you let us go
